      hu: "Lenyűgöző vályogerőd Ouarzazate-ban, amely egykor a hatalmas Glaoui család tulajdona volt. Kanyargós folyosói az atlaszi nemesség gazdagságát tükrözik.",
      ro: "O cetate impresionantă din lut în Ouarzazate, aparținând odinioară puternicei familii Glaoui. Coridoarele sale decorate reflectă bogăția nobilimii din Atlas.",
      en: "An impressive mud fortress in Ouarzazate that once belonged to the powerful Glaoui family. Its decorated rooms reflect the wealth of the Atlas nobility."
